        "ny" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imapeza zonena zotsimikizika m'mawu ndi kuwunika iliyonse, ndikubweza zotsatira monga JSON.\n\nINPUT — Mawu (Text) akhoza kukhala mawu enieni, kapena chinthu cha JSON chokhala ndi \"text\" kuphatikizapo chilichonse mwa: \"context-before\" ndi \"context-after\" (ndime yozungulira, yogwiritsidwa ntchito pokha kudziwa zomwe zonena yosabisa imatanthauza ndipo sichiwunikidwa konse), \"no-fact-checking\" (true imabweza zonena zokha, popanda kuzifufuza), ndi minda ya positi \"username\", \"usertype\" (Business, Government, Verified kapena None), \"datetime\" (pamene positi inalembedwa kapena kusinthidwa komaliza, monga nthawi ya ISO 8601 mu UTC — zonena zake zimawunika malinga ndi tsikuli osati lero), \"quoting\" ndi \"replyingTo\" (chilichonse chinthu cholowa cha mawonekedwe omwewo, cha positi ndi makolo ake).\n\nOUTPUT — chinthu cha JSON chokhala ndi kiyi pa mawu a zonena iliyonse yolembedwanso, yomwe mtengo wake ndi array yokhala ndi cholowa chimodzi pa zonena iliyonse yokhala ndi \"raw-text\" ndi \"is_hidden\" (ngati ulalo wa positi umayika chizindikiro pa zonena, ndikuzibisa mpaka kusankha kuvumbula gawo limenelo la positi); pokhapokha \"no-fact-checking\" inali true, cholowa chilichonse chimakhalanso ndi \"confidence-percentage\" ndi \"veracity-percentage\" (manambala athunthu, ndipo veracity imasunga chizindikiro chake: chabwino ndi choona, choipa ndi chabodza), \"reasoning\", \"sources\" (URL → dikishonale ya mutu) ndi \"annotations\" (kapangidwe komweko kamene kuwunika kwa zoona kumasonyeza mkati). Zolephera zimafotokozedwa mu array ya \"error-messages\" — pamlingo wapamwamba pa zolephera zomwe zinayimitsa kuthamanga, ndi pa cholowa cha zonena inayake pa zolephera zomwe zinayimitsa zonena imeneyo.\n\nKuthamanga kumafuna kuti DisinfaX ilowe mu akaunti pa chipangizo ichi."
          }
