        "sn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chengeta zvirevo zvinogona kusimbiswa muchinyorwa uye chinoongorora chokwadi pane chimwe nechimwe chazvo, chichidzorera mhedzisiro se JSON.\n\nINPUT — Chinyorwa chinogona kuva chinyorwa pachacho, kana chinhu che JSON chine \"text\" pamwe nechero chipi pane: \"context-before\" ne\"context-after\" (chikamu chakakomberedza, chinoshandiswa chete kujekesa kuti chirevo chakapfava chinorevei uye hachimbongororwe pachacho), \"no-fact-checking\" (true inodzorera zvirevo chete, pasina kuzviongorora), uye minda yepositi \"username\", \"usertype\" (Business, Government, Verified kana None), \"datetime\" (paya positi yakanyorwa, kana kuti yapedzisirwa kugadziridzwa, senguva ye ISO 8601 mu UTC — zvirevo zvayo zvinobva zvatongwa sezvenguva iyoyo kwete sezvanhasi), \"quoting\" ne\"replyingTo\" (chimwe nechimwe chinhu chakaiswa mukati chine chimiro chimwe chete, chepositi nemadzitateguru ayo).\n\nOUTPUT — chinhu che JSON chakiyiwa pane chinyorwa chechirevo chimwe nechimwe chakanyorwa patsva, chine ukoshi uri rondedzero ine chikamu chimwe pachirevo chimwe nechimwe chine \"raw-text\" ne\"is_hidden\" (kana link yepositi ichimaka chirevo, ichichichengeta chisingaonekwe kusvika sarudzo yafumura chikamu ichocho chepositi); kunze kwekunge \"no-fact-checking\" yanga iri true, chikamu chimwe nechimwe chinotakurawo \"confidence-percentage\" ne\"veracity-percentage\" (nhamba dzakazara, uye veracity inochengeta chiratidzo chayo: yakanaka ndeyechokwadi, yakaipa ndeyenhema), \"reasoning\", \"sources\" (duramazwi re URL → musoro) ne\"annotations\" (chimiro chimwe chete icho kuongorora chokwadi kunoratidza mukati). Kukundikana kunoshumwa murondedzero ye\"error-messages\" — padanho repamusoro pakukundikana kwakamisa kuitika, uye pachikamu chechirevo chimwe chete pakukundikana kwakamisa chirevo ichocho.\n\nKuitika kunoda kuti DisinfaX yapinda mune ichi chishandiso."
