        "zu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ithola izitatimende ezingaqinisekiswa embhalweni bese ihlola ngasinye sazo, bese ibuyisela umphumela njenge-JSON.\n\nOKOKUFaka — Umbhalo ungaba ngumbhalo ngokwawo, noma into ye-JSON equkethe \"text\" kanye nanoma ikuphi kwalokhu okulandelayo:\n\"context-before\" ne-\"context-after\" (ingxenye ezungezile; isetshenziswa kuphela ukucacisa ukuthi isitatimende esisodwa sibhekisa kukhona futhi yona ngokwayo ayihlolwa nanini), \"no-fact-checking\" (true ibuyisela izitatimende kuphela, ngaphandle kokuzicwaninga), kanye nezinkambu zokuthunyelwe \"username\", \"usertype\" (Business, Government, Verified noma None), \"datetime\" (isikhathi okwabhalwa ngaso okuthunyelwe noma okwagcina ukuhlelwa, njengesikhathi se-ISO 8601 nge-UTC — izitatimende zaso zihlolwa ngokwalolo suku hhayi ngokwalamuhla), \"quoting\" ne-\"replyingTo\" (ngayinye iyinto ye-JSON engaphakathi enomumo ofanayo, yokuthunyelwe kanye nozalo lwayo).\n\nOkokuphuma — into ye-JSON enezikhiya kumbhalo wesitatimende ngasinye esibhalwe kabusha, futhi inani li-uhlu olunomhlinzeki oyedwa wesitatimende ngasinye ophethe \"raw-text\" ne-\"is_hidden\" yaso (ukuthi isixhumanisi sokuthunyelwe siyasiphawula yini isitatimende, sisigcina singabonakali kuze kube ukukhetha kuveza leyo ngxenye yokuthunyelwe); ngaphandle uma \"no-fact-checking\" bekungu-true, umhlinzeki ngamunye futhi uphethe \"confidence-percentage\" ne-\"veracity-percentage\" (izinombolo eziphelele, futhi i-veracity igcina uphawu lwayo: okuhle kuyiqiniso, okubi kungamanga), \"reasoning\", \"sources\" (isichazamazwi se-URL → isihloko) ne-\"annotations\" (isakhiwo esifanayo esiboniswa ukuhlola emgqeni). Amaphutha abikwa ohlwini lwe-\"error-messages\" — ezingeni eliphezulu kumphutha owamisa ukusebenza, nasemhlinzekini wesitatimende esithile kumphutha owamisa leso sitatimende kuphela.\n\nUkusebenza kudinga ukuthi i-DisinfaX ingene ngemvume kule divayisi."
