        "ny" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pamene positi inalembedwa kapena kusinthidwa komaliza: chaka (2020), mwezi (2020-04), kapena tsiku (2020-04-07). Zonena zake zimawunika malinga ndi tsikuli osati lero."
