        },
        "om" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yeroo postiin barreesse yookaan dhumarratti gulaaliame: waggaa (2020), ji'a (2020-04), yookaan guyyaa (2020-04-07). Yaadonni isaa guyyaa kanaatiin madaalama, hara'aatiin miti."
